        "text": "Sixth Hair takes the final step in Lang Ya blessed land, with Lang Ya land spirit handing him the processed immortal material. A long crisp sound comes from the ice fire. The fire then extinguishes, leaving only the round profound ice. Sixth Hair calls for rank seven Immortal Gu Self Love to come out. The ice cracks and breaks, and the Immortal Gu flies out, finally refined.",
