  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land’s refinement hall, Lang Ya land spirit works a super Gu formation of icy blue fire around melting profound ice, with Sixth Hair assisting. The commission is Fang Yuan’s, paid in a huge amount of sect contribution points, and Fang Yuan required the human Gu refinement method rather than the hairy man heaven and earth style. After months of work they fail at the final steps for the fifth time. Fan door wind, a rank seven immortal material, is among the materials used. Sixth Hair has been observing and says Lang Ya land spirit has given the attempt his all. Fang Yuan treats the Gu as necessary so he can use a killer move from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance to dispel an investigative killer move on him. After the fifth failure he replies that Sixth Hair will do the refining while Lang Ya land spirit helps on the side.",
        "chapters": [
          1403
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "sys_super_gu_formation",
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "res_fan_door_wind",
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Sixth Hair sends it to Fang Yuan through treasure yellow heaven. Fang Yuan holds this Immortal Gu. It is not shaped like a worm. It looks like a horn shaped rice dumpling wrapped in bamboo leaves with grey-white threads on it. The bamboo leaf surface is one with the inside, and the grey-white threads are the Gu’s markings, flickering and changing location every few breaths. When activated inside the sovereign immortal aperture it floats, emits a sweet smell, and gives off no light. Mortal Gu move around it and form a river of Gu worms. That activation is the first step of immortal killer move self cleansing, and this Immortal Gu is needed for that first step. Self Love is the core of that move.",
        "chapters": [
          1407
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
